{"repositoryId":1416216594,"availability":"available","full":"scientistayat-engineer/Sentra-AI-Powered-Sentiment-Analysis","name":"Sentra-AI-Powered-Sentiment-Analysis","description":"AI-powered sentiment analysis web app. Classifies text as Positive, Negative or Neutral using a scikit-learn model (TF-IDF + Logistic Regression), with a Flask API, Firebase auth and history, and Vercel deployment.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-12T23:03:34Z","updated":"2026-10-13T07:26:34Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://sentra-ai-powered-sentiment-analysi.vercel.app","topics":["firebase","firestore","flask","html-css-javascript","javascript","logistic-regression","machine-learning","nlp","python","rest-api","scikit-learn","sentiment-analysis","td-idf","text-classification","vercel"],"demo":"https://sentra-ai-powered-sentiment-analysi.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:55.873Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:55.873Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T02:48:55.873Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T02:48:55.873Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Every review has a mood. Sentra finds it. Paste any customer comment and learn in a second whether it is Positive, Negative or Neutral, and which words decided it.","[]( [](docs/sentra-report.pdf) [](docs/sentra-presentation.pptx)","Businesses collect thousands of reviews, social posts and support messages. Reading them one by one is slow and subjective. Sentra turns every text into a clear sentiment label using a real machine-learning model (TF-IDF features and a scikit-learn classifier). Nothing is hard-coded or random: every result comes from a model trained on labelled data and evaluated on texts it never saw during training."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/scientistayat-engineer/Sentra-AI-Powered-Sentiment-Analysis/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7a20ca5